    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "two-homepage-states",
        "moduleId": "scene-intro",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "教材中的两个主页状态",
        "markdown": "教材在第 8 章末尾并置了 Watchlist 主页的两种样子：未登录访问时，导航栏只有 **Home** 和 **Login**，列表上方标注 **8 Titles**，8 条记录每条只跟一个 IMDb 链接；登录成功后再回到主页，同样的 8 条记录旁边多出了 **Edit** 和 **Delete**。数据没有增减，变化的只是同一页面呈现出来的操作区。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-e0a0d38f117bfe9c05dd311f",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000079"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "第8章：用户认证",
                "Grey Li's Watchlist"
              ],
              "lineStart": 555,
              "lineEnd": 592,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "53d1db46d4a4abb8d79fe3467d1ac968674145a517a9e203fac9ea784e0efc1b"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "state-difference-cause",
        "moduleId": "scene-intro",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "差异来自模板分支而非新页面",
        "markdown": "两张截图并不是两个相互独立的 HTML 文件，而是同一个主页模板在渲染时判断了当前用户的登录状态。模板里用 `{% if current_user.is_authenticated %}` 这类条件决定是否输出编辑、删除按钮，条件不成立时就整段跳过。因此「页面看起来不同」是模板分支的结果，数据库里的条目仍然只有那 8 条。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "two-homepage-states"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "anonymous-homepage",
        "moduleId": "anonymous-state",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "未登录主页逐项读图",
        "markdown": "未登录状态的截图中，标题区显示 `Home Login`，列表标题为 `8 Titles`，随后依次是：My Neighbor Totoro - 1988、Dead Poets Society - 1989、A Perfect World - 1993、Leon - 1994、Mahjong - 1996、King of Comedy - 1999、Devils on the Doorstep - 1999、The Pork of Music - 2012。每一条记录后面只跟着一个 `IMDb` 链接，没有编辑或删除入口。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-e0a0d38f117bfe9c05dd311f",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000079"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "第8章：用户认证",
                "Grey Li's Watchlist"
              ],
              "lineStart": 555,
              "lineEnd": 592,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "53d1db46d4a4abb8d79fe3467d1ac968674145a517a9e203fac9ea784e0efc1b"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "anonymous-visible-table",
        "moduleId": "anonymous-state",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "table",
        "title": "未登录时看得见什么",
        "markdown": "把截图拆成三层来读，可以把「缺了什么」看得很清楚：\n\n| 层级 | 未登录时的表现 | 说明 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 条目数据 | 8 条电影完整列出 | 数据层对未登录用户开放 |\n| 条目内链接 | 每条都有 IMDb 外链 | 浏览类操作不受限制 |\n| 操作入口 | 没有 Edit、Delete | 写操作入口被模板隐藏 |\n\n也就是说，未登录用户看到的是一个只读视图，但这只说明入口没渲染出来，不代表背后的视图函数没有保护。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "anonymous-homepage",
            "two-homepage-states"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "login-page-form",
        "moduleId": "signed-in-state",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "登录页的截图内容",
        "markdown": "同一段材料还给出了登录页面：导航栏保持 `Home Login`，表单区标题为 `Login`，字段是 `Username`（示例填写 `greyli`）和 `Password`，下方一个 `Submit` 按钮，页脚写着 `© 2018 HelloFlask`。这一页是用户从只读视图切换到可编辑视图的唯一入口。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-e0a0d38f117bfe9c05dd311f",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000079"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "第8章：用户认证",
                "Grey Li's Watchlist"
              ],
              "lineStart": 555,
              "lineEnd": 592,
              "assetRefs": [],
